    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx. 90.02 sq m / 968 sq ft \nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to introduce 28 Beech Lodge to the market for sale. This exceptionally well-positioned, two-bedroom, second-floor apartment is presented in turn-key condition and enjoys a rare dual-aspect layout with a wraparound balcony, setting it apart from many other apartments within the development. The apartment offers light-filled living spaces with picturesque views over the leafy grounds of Castleknock College.\n\n The accommodation briefly comprises an inviting L-shaped entrance hall with hot press/storage. The bright and airy open-plan living room, which features a gas fireplace and oak timber flooring, creates a warm and elegant atmosphere. The living area benefits from dual-aspect windows, allowing for excellent light and stunning views, and opens onto a modern, well-appointed kitchen equipped with quality integrated appliances and granite countertops. \n\nOff the hallway are two generous double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes. The main bedroom includes an ensuite bathroom and access to its own private balcony. A spacious family bathroom completes the layout. \n\nA particularly striking feature of this apartment is its south-west-facing wraparound balcony, accessed from the main living room, which further enhances the sense of space and privacy and allows for all-day sunlight and evening sunsets. Additionally, the apartment includes the use of two parking spaces and a designated underground lock-up storage unit (4 sq m / 43 sq ft), adding significant appeal for prospective buyers.\n\nLocated just off Whites Road, Farmleigh Woods is within walking distance of Castleknock Village with a selection of neighbourhood retail and service outlets. There is direct pedestrian access to the Phoenix Park from White`s Road and Farmleigh House is nearby. There are a choice of schools nearby which include St Brigids National School, Castleknock College, Mount Sackville and Educate Together Castleknock. Castleknock Train Station and bus routes are both conveniently located along with a wide range of sporting clubs such as St. Brigids and Castleknock Gaa as well as recreational amenities close by including Dublin Zoo, Luttrellstown,Castleknock and Elm Green golf courses, Castleknock Tennis Club and a choice of boating clubs. The City Centre, N3 and M50 are all easily accessible.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate this fine property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.49m (11'5\") x 3.77m (12'4\")\nSolid wood floor, hot press\n\nLounge - 6.09m (20'0\") x 5.27m (17'3\")\nSolid wood floor, feature fireplace with electric fire, access to wraparound balcony\n\nKitchen - 2.46m (8'1\") x 3.43m (11'3\")\nTiled floor, granite counter tops, fully fitted integrated kitchen\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.34m (10'11\") x 5.62m (18'5\")\nFlooring laid in carpet, fitted wardrobes, balcony access\n\nEnsuite - 2.11m (6'11\") x 2.04m (6'8\")\nTiled floor, shower, heated towel rail, wc, wash hand basin\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.14m (10'4\") x 4.28m (14'1\")\nFlooring laid in carpet, fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.35m (7'9\") x 1.68m (5'6\")\nFully tiled, bath and shower, heated towel rail, wc, wash hand basin\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious Two Bed Second Floor Apartment </li><li> Corner Positioned Apartment with Wraparound Balcony </li><li> Secure Storage / Lockup in Underground Carpark </li><li> Two Balconies - off Living Room and Master Bedroom </li><li> Secure Underground Parking </li><li> Built in 2006 </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Ready for Immediate Occupation </li><li> Beautifully Maintained Development Close to a Host of Local Amenities</li></ul>"
